{
  "name": "Support ticket triage",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Support ticket triage\n\n1. Select credentials on the OpenAI, Slack, and Google Sheets nodes.\n2. In Config, paste the spreadsheet id and the Slack channel name (without a hash).\n3. Create a sheet whose first row is TicketId, ReceivedAt, RequesterEmail, Subject, Category, Priority, Team, Summary, NeedsHuman.\n4. Activate the workflow, then POST a ticket to the webhook path support-ticket-triage.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0aa69c22-3097-489b-b0d2-b1fadef4d452",
      "name": "Setup notes",
